            <div class="username"><h1>Gorgon Ramsay</h1></div>
            <div class="description">
              <ul>
                <li>👨‍🍳 Chef | Content Creator | Food Enthusiast</li>
                <li>🍚 "Walang tapon!"</li>
                <p>
                  Musta, mga tol! I'm Ninong Ry—your friendly neighborhood cook who believes in good food, good vibes, and walang sayang sa kusina! Whether it's making crispy lechon, budget-friendly ulam, or experimental dishes (with extra mantika for flavor, syempre), I love sharing my passion for cooking in the most unfiltered, down-to-earth way possible.

From street food to gourmet, my goal is to make cooking fun, simple, and accessible for everyone—kahit ‘di ka marunong magluto, laban lang! Expect laughter, a bit of chaos, and a lot of deliciousness in every video.

Tara, kain tayo! 🍻🔥

📍 Follow me for recipes, kitchen tips, and kulitan moments!
                </p>
